      "locked": false,
      "text": "the first name, and Technical details. Not in phase 3a: owning a name (the hub with names, changing where a name points, renewing), transfers, subnames, and expiry reminders by message.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
